2. **Condition Group 2 (single condition, no AND group needed):**  
   - Moves **at least 40,000 passengers annually**. *(Note: No candidate explicitly states this; it must be evaluated as possibly false.)*

3. **Condition Group 3 (single condition, no AND group needed):**  
   - Possesses an **FAA Air Carrier Certificate**.

